        "objective": "Implement TASK-0092 acceptance criteria. 1) Add\ncontracts/schemas/boundary-contract.schema.json defining the five\ntyped entry kinds (must, must_not, completion_signal, free_zone,\nopen_question) with required unique entry IDs, plus an example\nrecord examples/records/boundary-contract.json that validates\nagainst it. Do NOT edit scripts/lint_contracts.py or anything under\nscripts/ -- that path is outside your write boundary; the trusted\nmaintainer registers the schema/example in the linter after this\nnode completes. 2) Add\nsrc/ahra/boundary_contract.py with frozen domain objects that parse\nand validate a boundary contract; freeze validation must reject\ncontracts containing open_question entries, duplicate entry IDs, or\nunknown kinds; cover with tests/test_boundary_contract.py. 3) In\nsrc/ahra/alignment_session.py, make the Human Gate 1 freeze path\nrecord the typed boundary contract and its sha256 digest in the\nimmutable session snapshot, keeping the prose requirement as trace\nonly; cover with tests/test_alignment_session.py. Run\nuv run python -B scripts/check.py and record it in\nWorkReport.verification_commands_run.\n",
